@startuml
title Fetch Feature Flags (V1)

actor Scheduler
participant "FeatureFlagClient SDK" as SDK
participant "Feature Flag API" as API
participant "FeatureFlagService" as Service
database "FeatureFlagRepository" as Repo
collections "InMemory Cache" as Cache

Scheduler -> SDK: trigger refresh()

SDK -> API: GET /sdk/flags

API -> Service: fetchFlags(environmentKey)

Service -> Repo: findByEnvironment()

Repo --> Service: flags

Service --> API: feature flags payload

API --> SDK: 200 OK + flags

SDK -> Cache: replace cache

@enduml
